  "private": true,
  "description": "Infinite Agent: a Node-compatible layer for the browser — core-module polyfills over AgentFs, a CommonJS/ESM loader with node_modules resolution, an npm client over the public registry, and a Worker-per-process model. The 'own WebContainers' layers of docs/HANDOFF-infinite-agent.md.",
